Problems in China and with iPhone sales held sales and profit back. But Apple still has $130 billion in cash at its disposal.\n- Shares of chipmaker Advanced Micro Devices (NASDAQ:AMD) moved higher as the company said it sees a stronger-than-expected performance in 2019. Fourth-quarter revenue missed estimates, however.\n- Medical-equipment maker Stryker (NYSE:SYK) shares were up nearly 5% to $169 after hours after fourth-quarter revenue beat estimates.\n- Shares of eBay (NASDAQ:EBAY) were down nearly 1% to $33.40, even as fourth-quarter earnings and revenue beat estimates . The stock has largely recovered its steep decline between August and Christmas. But the shares are still off about 29% from its 52-week high reached in January 2018.\n- Principal Financial Group (NASDAQ:PFG) shares were flat at $49.62. They did slide as much as 3.2% after hours. The Des Moines, Iowa,-based insurance and financial services company reported operating earnings of $1.11, below the Street estimate by 18 cents .\nRelated Articles\nNissan CEO eyes first talks with new Renault chairman on Thursday: NHK\nApple relief steadies Asian stocks, investors await Fed, U.S.-China talks\nApple lowers some iPhone prices outside U.S. to offset strong dollar", "external_links": ["https://invst.ly/9x525&quot;", "https://www.investing.com/equities/adv-micro-device-earnings?utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=yahoo_finance&quot;", "https://www.investing.com/news/stock-market-news/nissan-ceo-eyes-first-talks-with-new-renault-chairman-on-thursday-nhk-1762533?utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=yahoo_finance&quot;", "https://www.investing.com/equities/ebay-inc-earnings?utm_source=yahoo&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=yahoo_finance", "https://www.investing.com/equities/stryker-earnings?utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=yahoo_finance&quot;", "https://www.investing.com/equities/ebay-inc-earnings?utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;u